<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:40:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>BCG 探讨首席执行官彻夜难眠的原因</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/bcg-on-what-s-keeping-ceos-up-at-night-video</link><description>从人工智能和员工信任到政治不确定性和增长压力，波士顿咨询集团的一项新调查揭示了商业领袖面临的压力。 BCG 欧洲、中东和非洲地区执行合伙人 Matthias Tauber 在彭博市场上与 Stephen Carroll 讨论了首席执行官们彻夜难眠的原因。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/bcg-on-what-s-keeping-ceos-up-at-night-video'&gt;BCG 探讨首席执行官彻夜难眠的原因&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：BCG on What’s Keeping CEOs Up at Night&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/bcg-on-what-s-keeping-ceos-up-at-night-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:20:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>BBVA 考虑使用 SRT 对冲约 5 亿美元的数据中心贷款</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/bbva-weighs-srt-to-hedge-about-500-million-of-data-center-loans</link><description>BBVA SA 正在考虑一项交易，以减轻约 5 亿欧元（5.47 亿美元）数据中心贷款的风险，世界各地的银行都在探索多种方法来对冲人工智能相关基础设施的风险。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/bbva-weighs-srt-to-hedge-about-500-million-of-data-center-loans'&gt;BBVA 考虑使用 SRT 对冲约 5 亿美元的数据中心贷款&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：BBVA Eyes Hedge for About $500 million in Data Center Loans&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/bbva-weighs-srt-to-hedge-about-500-million-of-data-center-loans</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:27:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>英国因寒流而面临电力供应紧张的第三天</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/uk-faces-third-day-of-strained-electricity-supplies-on-cold-snap</link><description>英国周四再次面临电力供应紧张，寒流提振需求，导致电力供应紧张局面延续。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/uk-faces-third-day-of-strained-electricity-supplies-on-cold-snap'&gt;英国因寒流而面临电力供应紧张的第三天&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Europe Power Prices Surge as UK Issues Another Margin Warning&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/uk-faces-third-day-of-strained-electricity-supplies-on-cold-snap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 07:05:06 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>仲量联行对这个假期的看法</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/what-jll-sees-this-holiday-season-video</link><description>JLL 的 2026 年假日零售报告发现，假日支出比去年增长 9.7%，越来越多的消费者将更多预算用于体验。仲量联行零售咨询服务总裁 Naveen Jaggi 在彭博市场上与 Stephen Carroll 讨论了假日购物趋势和零售房地产前景。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/what-jll-sees-this-holiday-season-video'&gt;仲量联行对这个假期的看法&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：What JLL Sees This Holiday Season&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/what-jll-sees-this-holiday-season-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:25:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>奥驰亚研究卷烟制造商帝国品牌的交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands</link><description>奥驰亚集团公司正在研究一项收购英国卷烟制造商帝国品牌公司的潜在交易，这将是十年来对英国公司最大的收购之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands'&gt;奥驰亚研究卷烟制造商帝国品牌的交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Altria, Japan Tobacco Explore Breakup of Imperial Brands&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:08:53 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>